From 7aa5c2a1d542652c8243909ce4d09a17fe58d6e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dreknil <>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:40:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [android] Show Wardrive Bridge status on the map and in
 Android Auto

Adds a status line (run state, WIGLE/WDGW/BT counts, CYD and rig
links) over the phone map and the Android Auto map, plus a start/stop
button in the car's navigation action strip. All data comes from the
standalone Wardrive Bridge app through its content provider; this app
does no scanning and never talks to the rig itself.

Also drops the debug-only "Simulate Route" action from the car action
strip, which pushed it past NavigationTemplate's 4-action limit and
crashed on render.

LLM tools were used to write this change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: dreknil <>
